  "description": "Original team 'Product' from cobusgreyling/grok-bot-templates@4f3f28b4e657 (MIT): lead product-performance; bots product-performance, feature-ask-collator, launch-coordinator. Why: Latency, Slack asks, and launch day collide unless one Bot owns evidence, one clusters asks, and one refuses to publish. Group kickoff (original): @Product Performance investigate the named latency spike with dashboards and traces. @Feature Ask Collator cluster Slack asks without filing. @Launch Coordinator keep the launch checklist honest and stop at go/no-go. Do not change production. Do not file issues. Do not publish.",
